Ayuh, berikan segalanya!

830
00:44:08.479 --> 00:44:09.980
Jangan meletihkan diri anda!

831
00:44:10.564 --> 00:44:11.482
Baiklah!

832
00:44:11.565 --> 00:44:12.775
bagus!

833
00:44:13.776 --> 00:44:14.818
Mereka sudah bertukar?

834
00:44:15.486 --> 00:44:17.946
Salah satu pasukan telah bertukar pelari!

835
00:44:18.447 --> 00:44:19.823
Nampak bagus!

836
00:44:20.741 --> 00:44:22.034
Dua setengah minit!

837
